            r1_brief: `The Ruta Formal kick-off. Licda. Sapón explains the options: register at the SAT as an individual in the small-taxpayer regime (5% of sales, up to Q150,000 a year); register in the general regime; or set up a company, as a neighbour's lawyer advised "to do things properly". Another participant says: "Why bother? If I register, they charge me."`,
