            r1_title: `Round 1 — Monday 4 January 2027: whether and how to register, and the books`,
            r2_brief: `Lic. Otoniel Chávez, purchasing manager of the agro-exporter Hortalizas Altiplano Mam, offers a standing order of about Q16,000 a month of work shirts and caps, paid at 30 days against an electronic invoice (FEL). Your cousin Brenda, who is registered, offers to invoice it in her name for 8%. The order needs a second pair of hands: Rosaura Tzunún, who used to sew in a factory, is available; Doña Herlinda, a registered independent seamstress, sews by the piece from home.`,
